      "width": 380,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### 🏢 注目企業\n- [[Entities/Anthropic|Anthropic]]\n- [[Entities/NVIDIA|NVIDIA]]\n- [[Entities/Amazon|Amazon]]\n- [[Entities/GitHub|GitHub]]\n\n### ⚙️ 注目技術\n- [[Technologies/LLM|LLM]]\n- [[Technologies/RAG|RAG]]"
